@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000

### List books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Get one book
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Create book (librarian, no cover)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BoundaryXYZ

------BoundaryXYZ
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

The Hobbit
------BoundaryXYZ
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isbn"

9780000001
------BoundaryXYZ
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="publication_year"

1937
------BoundaryXYZ
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="genre"

Fantasy
------BoundaryXYZ--

### Update book (librarian)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BoundaryXYZ

------BoundaryXYZ
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Updated Title
------BoundaryXYZ--

### Delete book (librarian)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}